{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:53305e589baa3f5009d6f15348c14d1241275a96a53f062924f3d155f5d45c7f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce8003f308cccab75f21a86101fa3c75e69705c02095f450bdc4b0c4dffbbd38",
      "text": "开始律动的旋律",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1676279c24b5ef64f7ac7cf5a085b253aad6af1e9b84a209c89208f6562c80d8",
      "text": "丽独自一人在别墅里拉着小提琴。\n碰巧来到那里的制作人上前搭话，然而……另一方面，制作人前去\n向发掘过的圭索取答复。\n圭给出的回答是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce8003f308cccab75f21a86101fa3c75e69705c02095f450bdc4b0c4dffbbd38",
      "text": "开始律动的旋律",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0376531feb7e4878e63ebceeac0fdbb6331d4e7b1254c0ae1d307998d6fd196",
      "text": "为了今后集训能够使用，把社长的别墅整修一下吧。\n这也是制作人的重要工作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a912db770e244a835f2f9d525b1e0576a4259ad929790e2625d9ba10ccdb6814",
      "text": "好，首先去确认一下别墅的状况吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e207b05e5bb65e2f7855915d5070ae92e4747da18c9f669663551fecc2623363",
      "text": "必需品的清单列完了，\n在附近稍微转转看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c01665e106af1c7f94e7b95f4ffd4a216fb9a48dc18728eb87b212c673307013",
      "text": "……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:111338f5eeb9a1debaccee47c8a9700a372d2f1e3a96479288808f0414d4eef6",
      "text": "…………？\n小提琴的声音？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e380490ca9fb75305bfb4251267debadbdf04b57a149150ec75a09e27c26278",
      "text": "是从这附近传来的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5999fb8c439aedc310fc22e9b23faada72dc7422a48e55a6526491f7b19cc31",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c6fa31094cd2c7f8a960de249a22ab82322c84195c467eb9d8246a896134b63",
      "text": "（找到了，是他演奏出这首曲子的吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5999fb8c439aedc310fc22e9b23faada72dc7422a48e55a6526491f7b19cc31",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e878a705377d57440ecf56f520e6975ded8dd1d69d215929adc7210e0547557d",
      "text": "（多么美妙的音色啊。\n让人想要一直听下去……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f42a8668d5f2b72cf793fe8b509ccb07fa6fd6c6cf22e65233a1dc7a7aaaf6fb",
      "text": "（……明明曾经痛苦到甚至连触碰都不愿）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a435407029f13de5a08cf001a48600c7e9d634726eb2cc8bece75bc6a4a011ea",
      "text": "（无论如何，也无法离开小提琴。\n……因为这就是，我人生的全部啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c01665e106af1c7f94e7b95f4ffd4a216fb9a48dc18728eb87b212c673307013",
      "text": "……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f4d833457423f9df6cf3d92b552f7fd9563b92c27ed889e6bfb8ef980118664",
      "text": "（啊啊，这就是小提琴的音色。\n我曾经深爱着的，那段旋律）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5249fbd56f7e0cac0b15c1882bf65c501670e8ec231874668d7522503366194d",
      "text": "（一个人的话，就能像从前一样演奏了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58af85514e638fe66eacd810cb64db734bcaf64cec3c6d85710bf2addf54b8f9",
      "text": "（我在渴求着这种声音。\n无论是过去，还是将来，我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12c4a7970f60026d79fc1ddffe7ddaabaa883193e130bb4cb5e54114f4d175bd",
      "text": "（都想与音乐，长相厮守……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f54da720bfbdba0099a41edd92b082ed4cd94f6291daed5079df9d49c0256bc",
      "text": "汪汪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0d83ed3fb6a7a17cdafef450d7074bdddafba5d7743d397df950842f5a5f40e",
      "text": "阿尔托？\n怎么了，突然叫起来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21a5c984088f213734859ae1ac88fe16a61f59a14dd73547db5fb8fb6ea026ce",
      "text": "……？\n有人？在这么深的山里……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d",
      "text": "啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bcb40e6e368abea8fc2ffd293d44376d1bd32ba7cad1b8970582b59366b7724",
      "text": "不好意思，打扰到您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7453707735eae162e2ad10ef6b05725e2b9870159f377d54d567dd329a1c51e",
      "text": "不，没那回事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1833ae0345ee9cca9569e08b28accff7e3e55c6d3fd65d3ce29af081b49fe83",
      "text": "真是精彩绝伦的音色。\n忍不住听得入迷了……深深震撼了我的心灵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:166a3cde4293b9b949a8d7e5d088b69eaec226ccd6fc588ed327d6e3382fbdfc",
      "text": "……谢谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c84cbe3f3c7654413e257110e0349d15c2ebacf8b4bd9119703a3f4a3a737bf9",
      "text": "那么，我先告辞了。\n阿尔托，过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40d5277e9f1bdbfc3a03d16c1214bb4fef35b5a245559f81174ab1691ce6c666",
      "text": "啊……方便的话，请收下这个好吗？\n这是我的名片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2ae70391d290ebf1bb9c8ef148671b4d781fb50d8dc2832afa60bf6a2cd79c6",
      "text": "315 Production……制作人？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b3d3a1437dfcf0773cb50546cf901b6c89e2b8f24c68bc85ca13d1beed8d20a",
      "text": "是的，请让我担任您的制作人吧！\n我想把您的音乐，传达给更多的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da508dba818309f958fae4463ba760f9fc3f39c316b022ca631b6b9bd2ca0931",
      "text": "……！\n传达给更多人……那种事，现在的我做不到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:537d2bd444991251463aad366a06c4116824c4b28dca76238e49480d17ee0b67",
      "text": "虽然您可能无法立刻下决断，\n但请您务必考虑一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e48f33ba2c9a43f31c1427d15c2af9afc8bbf0e5442b0b4d7f5909ff46b978e",
      "text": "……不，不用考虑了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41b5b3a7124f2d74070426f218e5e980b46d5b31478866903b587dfbfb204934",
      "text": "抱歉，请回吧。\n我没有听阁下说话的打算。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3fd5a9db311f069ed95c1b3141382d751814f016788f0b1736915bfe93a1ef6",
      "text": "您的琴音打动了我的心。\n这份感动，我相信全世界的人都在渴求着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98fab70581b3fa48f037cdcccd2d953ad5777a17baa54436b57b238b8f961b50",
      "text": "您愿意和我一起，去把感动传达给他们吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fe38d63cbffe676b4c3a946e7adeb88a75a52966ceaa3a2bb2739e031191907",
      "text": "（把感动，传达给全世界……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:231eb09df2ec7dc220ea50e7e81b37ef1a1f1a58e714b6f6a80b85fd6dc8618a",
      "text": "（如果能把我的音乐，传达给\n那么多的人的话）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:036b93b85a1f4c71d8df170cce4e33e9f073f895e3b2fe0db5ad6a5cb56211ee",
      "text": "（若是能传达给真正热爱音乐、\n需要音乐的人们的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a03b9ae4cd471ffc32311bb8bff9f02aced869e9c3acc316853df33781fa945",
      "text": "（……但是，现在的我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:003549f02a4a8494b9419186444f4986a9d83ae9e0c124bbe6cd6e6ed28224e2",
      "text": "我已经无法站在人前了。\n我的心输给了那些唯利是图之徒……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26fb9a32462394743332e5e55103e8a55a13bd5c5f1ab69e6a018f5f792be0a",
      "text": "……走吧，阿尔托。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c7eb5ee152f899168b7995c5970ac0adab5a860be1566e0a5d870d6e0a237cb",
      "text": "今天也没有联系。\n但是，那个歌声真的太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1770fecd3d38b9c3c1fc0efac4c6c6430821500189e55d4e6e39867cc79fedf",
      "text": "想把这份感动传达给更多人。\n如果可以的话，想再去发掘他一次，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c62399950082d0393c9a4bd06408fee32d406519c5282f0ce693794db32a93f5",
      "text": "也没那么容易就能再遇到吧。\n至少问个名字就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c34df26a8b89ceeab865f516596b5778c1a80d46a181e31b60a812e938fb621",
      "text": "呼……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8094bedf2f09195e6463a2dcdc24e4032c6e2a6357ebccf34d511a34b4da9275",
      "text": "咦？\n在那边睡着的不是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0434fa536237735f7f39d8a9799f6526a3e08e9ceb038ce20ff23ebf63f38b32",
      "text": "呼……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:252f3d4e02e7e39660ec5026e3c8c4f25ceb55c22744f82c27ddf21d68f3f3ca",
      "text": "果、果然是他！\n过去看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ca561a7e1dc39a902129cc07a142ca7cf2c3ea28acbf04ac6eba8acb7383d97",
      "text": "嗯……\n这个脚步声是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f586a19d13bb511cf50c50d43d4c57f5864b8fbae0f43622e5397fd75bb72e25",
      "text": "……？\n你是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95de4f7f02b4746535ddff1c6de269be277bef18e7bd6f807d3b5836d78dc5cc",
      "text": "…………？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b3e86f22f3bd5f6d5930a1567aeb5edc9b2a2702585faecca407a116a56616e",
      "text": "不好意思，吵醒您了。\n您原本睡得那么香。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25bdddac34bb5c69f90a7410411019250c57d73fbf0186c584c6b4abdc54bc8b",
      "text": "啊啊，不用在意。\n我只是在打盹而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cd9ad63967dd434a4804b09997fd566977e01503bdccd5fb8937f0fc9abaaec",
      "text": "那样就好。\n在外面熟睡可是很危险的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a0bdb934b0aced24cb5666bd8b6fe7098b97351ab4e868ef81671145cb05b4d",
      "text": "是啊。\n但是，散步中途走累了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24a36afe2d7ae089fc2c2452e0f4ac467e4d9876d7408427877f122d8c3c4cb4",
      "text": "正好看到有个可以坐下的地方，\n休息着休息着，不小心就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09526e22bc119be1f3755652e720f058b4b9eadf3c7427860af10393a549a572",
      "text": "哈欠……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a237e94ac4db73ca380d8c7a67553d429e4358f6071e4bad6c269c8dd208722",
      "text": "（一边跟我说话一边又要睡过去了。\n何等的大人物作风啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0752a5c3333b3e0e1ba01b50c393ac20fe591b8eab5ef63c237ef2ea325d282",
      "text": "话说回来，你是哪位？\n我们在哪里见过吗……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:812a93fc4da4cff3242a7aa0c69cc667d939f11dd4538fe6f57298e1e71b8d40",
      "text": "是下雨那天送我回家的人呢。说起来，\n那时忘记跟你道谢了……谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da4da3e260407e777d4f2ac54025543f3b53a248faa43dcb5e2fa328fad8fa36",
      "text": "难道说，您之前不知道我是谁\n就在和我聊天吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d17560b71bcf616007935073f4cf2c563636b3344720651b98c0f29867cb07cc",
      "text": "（居然能和素不相识的人聊得这么自然。\n越来越觉得是位大人物了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0950d28b750bb3f0dea9f6a87ba29b90323156e7a97dadbc1477b69dc774a68",
      "text": "今天怎么了吗？\n你也是来这里散步的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a986f39bfc6fbbabab14ca05de48fd0d93f42d074b402351f1126214cd512da",
      "text": "不，我是想听听前几天那件事的答复，\n一直在找您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f1240ef6bf5355edda2c0889814e6388e50773e2378a689b229366a3675aab5",
      "text": "既然一直没有联络，\n虽然我想大概就是那个意思了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cc71ff2b3f67b817ca4bf83f802d1226e1f7e3a19812c7925524aea4de3196f",
      "text": "答复……？啊啊，说起来。\n我记得把收到的名片放在口袋里了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c61472992c948660617473aa2031057bfd041ae2b94716f3382a9f6013309179",
      "text": "对了对了，是偶像事务所的\n制作人吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a75bb2adc56c51e8b3b490b2c2f495f02ff9b5356e7fe7d10ab940245e2075dd",
      "text": "难道说，名片一直都带在身上……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a21e5ba76f08e67d6628af0f82d4fb0e7cb8e500ddd4bd8ad68eae210b5bad1",
      "text": "啊啊，倒也不是贴身携带着啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee43ca9f8f95d2b1d641bd05cc37d25b72c6efb7775d5f433ec88dd79dd9f8e3",
      "text": "我对生活不太讲究……\n衣服也经常是穿别人送的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aac88df0a658c42b6092443c147a1771e230c8ba422032042d853149f30de96",
      "text": "这张名片大概也只是顺手放着没拿出来而已。\n抱歉哦，我就是这么随性的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92df488f99239c76e769b5d8daa7c37ef8a694ab82b7af21bf3cdf30cd7c95bd",
      "text": "不，非常感谢您没有把它扔掉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d1deebc3ad4989fecf0e6cd3a6f42c1f6435610dd00d61f2dd68a5e08a5b919",
      "text": "那么，所谓的答复是指……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf501d778a89db1a0eb728b375a45f2018ab7226dbcfe1859d52e47eedca6df",
      "text": "想让我去当偶像的那件事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8b450978c72a5083e759aa5a6e371e51d8f62729a6e36f6469fb232cebe56bd",
      "text": "是的。我希望您的歌声\n能够让更多的人听到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c64eb25622ca5ad36cda8389cee50a1bfb47fdc36ba9bc3646660d58530e49f2",
      "text": "请您务必考虑一下好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73214b7e4e2c0470851b0ff30d86787829a3b7a8d6231eecfa3a4c406b3f01d9",
      "text": "偶像这种存在，\n对我来说是“正在寻找之物”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19ada9eaad63c451945b8b14777494872b5fcd7714f52e821aae075968b12441",
      "text": "我想伴随在那个身影身旁……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c311a60d3f5104fe21918bbe8100de805bc0b6e81752bbd17235ba31c8a09c41",
      "text": "仅仅想聆听着，由偶像\n注入了生命的音乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e9744c195ad89697764aaef490ff055c0ddaad5716b4aef1905068e66d500ca",
      "text": "如果可能的话……\n想再一次目睹那个瞬间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cf62b2f78d7740b3b32986e5cf697fbcee9076eefa07034e849412f3eff09b6",
      "text": "……所以，我自己去当偶像什么的，\n实在难以想象呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a251cc0236d4617ede01caaa366ed2e0ea0b47b8c8dd18f1e890517f8af6abba",
      "text": "姑且算是有过唱歌的经验吧。\n毕竟做了很多年，虽然我更擅长作曲就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:453df9dc41ec84ec526180e84ca96fe2ed0e360c886eb28b044ee10529d53f4a",
      "text": "但是除此以外的事……我全都不会做呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3514d692be161abc65d207515bc881e3ff86bdbb126c16f50d3e72d0aa152a7",
      "text": "（为什么大家都会觉得\n我能当得了偶像呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f957b44a357311d8fb55dee2881ceac49ec2edb345f11d2cd293b92e927d0c9e",
      "text": "（说起来，被发掘的那天也是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000038:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f544a5b874e07641873b6e82f776f76e4c57cd9e7d3aeac23e601045da978837",
      "text": "圭的朋友家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:deb46070b877bd38011790a94379a09e06ee30e1f6e619d94b96263c629b3af0",
      "text": "那个，所谓的发掘，\n不是什么可疑的勾当吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39d62fa70336308992ce749c7dea0f247bcc32f90cc9be3999bc80be96e12988",
      "text": "谁知道呢。\n姑且拿到了一张名片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97fe96e91a8f4874351e4939f701616cdd7715f36648ddb7797debbc5757b243",
      "text": "唔……看起来倒也没那么可疑……\n然后呢？为什么会被发掘啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc6bee0aad8990b6b78d493840089989f5cdf0ba6dfcab2b6aa4cc8f227fcb58",
      "text": "因为我在唱歌。\n对方似乎听到了那个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d1f2ea9905482c558862b8480b982788e1965ce9228bf762488af5d7daf2192",
      "text": "原来如此。\n毕竟圭的歌声很吸引人嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1e5312dee3a99b12c5bd6c1f173c24ce5ae9b6f6e8e2cf066b2a4eec028ba33",
      "text": "不仅如此。你还有作曲的才能。\n说不定会成为活用那份才能的好契机呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfd7660036e9c1955dec287aae7d1f87113095730b7a69a03b0740e58345809",
      "text": "我的才能……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_i:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a86644a4b27107a834b52bf79f15ce213e3be7972727f290d2b67e0e871f0369",
      "text": "只要你自己不排斥，\n去试试看也不错吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae563d401510c89e64ef36e736fa333ed63c370ef668eb12d0e60ea4630db61",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35cf919258f70c2af86abfec7a77fdef5e44179cc4b93205737e325a6778481f",
      "text": "啊啊，抱歉。\n在想点事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7888e48179a8fcd72bb8478fd5a30d3102402d9e59c19e8992934139ffd76fd9",
      "text": "你真的那么想让我当偶像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab77c5e53445706961a811a28c9d418756688287da0fd28a52bf58027c2816c4",
      "text": "是的！请让我把您那绝妙的歌声，\n传达给全世界。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbe03bbafcebcba9bd46b8cd08091d8662ac597be229b270cc874d11976c5feb",
      "text": "（……这个人也好，朋友也好，\n不知为何都觉得我有可能性呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:471a9f10abb14697f2269853141be34fbd0241de5853f69d5915ea6b1868016c",
      "text": "（明明我自己一点都不觉得自己能行呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77f033c970f3b8662e4dda32c78e016b33201cb9f4575509328ef814cf131f1b",
      "text": "（但是……他推了这样的我一把）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:181a98c6034380fc5410777251fa0e96626fdbd01caa47c53d3c0b1d1a113408",
      "text": "（现在这个人，也在拼命地拉着我的手）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c1d26420f5876fa8d387ff2d9cf63a2d43eca7301bafddc6e0d4e613453cf8d",
      "text": "（稍微……\n试着站起来一下，或许也不错吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcde27ad638a46264e32d05bdbc15af3195b2c110c475247407e80cdf0887b71",
      "text": "……嗯，我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_02_1_1_003_02:1_1_003_02_j:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6073a6f8e6a4a303ccbc965a505125115577351e8043ce2bfcb99774acf7ab0",
      "text": "我决定听听你的想法。\n能告诉我，我能做些什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
